    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "contentRef": "section:recovery:paragraph:0",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "label": "分別驗證備份成功與可還原性",
          "text": "備份任務成功表示已建立復原資料，但不代表一定能還原至所需狀態，也不代表應用程式可以使用。",
          "words": 31
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:recovery:paragraph:1",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "label": "分別驗證備份成功與可還原性",
          "text": "決定復原點、還原目的地、RTO、RPO、資料完整性和應用程式連線的驗證方法。如同 AWS Backup restore testing，在隔離環境中實際執行還原並進行評估。",
          "words": 35
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:recovery:paragraph:2",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "label": "分別驗證備份成功與可還原性",
          "text": "還原測試不會覆寫生產環境。記錄所需時間、遺漏內容和重新連線程序，並更新計畫與實測結果之間的差異。",
          "words": 29
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 35,
      "id": "fundamentals.data-protection:section:recovery:concept:1",
      "kind": "reading",
      "label": "分別驗證備份成功與可還原性",
      "objectiveIds": [
        "recovery"
      ],
      "sectionId": "recovery",
      "sources": [],
      "style": "normal",
      "unitId": "fundamentals.data-protection",
      "position": 16,
      "remainingSteps": 23,
      "totalSteps": 39
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "contentRef": "section:recovery:scenario",
          "kind": "scenario",
          "label": "情況",
          "text": "訂單資料庫的夜間備份成功，但復原程序尚未經過測試。",
          "words": 16
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:recovery:step:0",
          "kind": "steps",
          "label": "步驟 1",
          "text": "決定復原點和隔離的復原目標。",
          "words": 9
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:recovery:step:1",
          "kind": "steps",
          "label": "步驟 2",
          "text": "執行復原並確認資料庫完整性及應用程式連線。",
          "words": 11
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 18,
      "id": "fundamentals.data-protection:section:recovery:example:1",
      "kind": "example",
      "label": "具體範例",
      "objectiveIds": [
        "recovery"
